   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LSU Tackling Poverty Together</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LSU Tackling Poverty Together</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Last phase of the cooperation between LSU, UNDESA and Youth  organisations from 8 countries in Africa (Liberia, Uganda, Ghana, Tanzania, Malawi, Zimbabwe, Zambia and Kenya) with the purpose to enhance young peoples knowledge about poverty reduction strategies and to strengthen their active participation in the PRS processes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sista fasen i ett samarbete mellan LSU, UNDESA och 8 ungdoms organisationer fr&#xe5;n 8 afrikanska stater i syfte att st&#xe4;rka ungdommars kunskap, n&#xe4;tverkande och aktiva deltagande i arbetet med  fattigdomsstrategier.</narrative>
  </description>
